  "content": {
    "title": "Sandbox — Model Bank",
    "intro": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "To support onboarding and early development, a Model Bank has been deployed within the sandbox environment. This simulated Licensed Financial Institution mirrors the structure and behavior of a real LFI, providing TPPs with a safe, compliant space to test their end-to-end integration flows."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The Model Bank is registered in the Trust Framework and exposes Authorization Servers, discovery endpoints, and Open Finance APIs — just like any production LFI. TPPs can use it to:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "Explore API discovery via the.well-known endpoint",
          "Test registration with real (sandbox) software statements",
          "Validate certificate-based authentication and mutual TLS setups",
          "Simulate consent flows, account access, and payment initiation"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
